===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ḱer- (grow)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|encresen}}, borrowed from {{der|en|xno|encreistre}}, from {{der|en|la|increscō|increscere|t=to increase}}, from {{m|la|in||in, on}} + {{m|la|crescō||grow}}.

The noun is from {{inh|en|enm|encres}}, from the verb.

